{
  "id": "worlds-2026",
  "name": "World Championship 2026",
  "editions": ["ed:worlds-2026"],
  "sources": ["https://lol.fandom.com/wiki/2026_Season_World_Championship"],
  "notes": [
    "Play-In: one GSL group of four, Bo5, then a Bo5 final between the winners' match and decider winners; only the final's winner joins the Swiss stage. Swiss: 16 teams, three wins or losses, Bo3 when a match can decide advancement or elimination, otherwise Bo1. Knockout: 8-team single elimination, Bo5.",
    "The Play-In is verified by replaying the recorded results. The Swiss and Knockout stages follow the 2025 format and are checked against results as they are played.",
    "Not modelled: the Swiss round-1 pools, region protection in draws, and the exact knockout draw. Forward simulations draw these randomly, except that undefeated Swiss teams are kept apart and face 3-2 teams."
  ],
